{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And you shall make, the work of an embroiderer.</b> Less than the work of a weaver. And the pillars overlaid with gold, also their hooks of gold, on account of the honor of the Place; and the sockets for the pillars, copper, for it is intermediate."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:38.638007945Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}